  "_comment": "Reply-pipeline classification goldens. Every case asserts the canonical disposition (and objection class where one applies) for one inbound message. `pipeline_layer` names which layer of the 3-layer pipeline proves it: `deterministic` (worker layer 1 — DSN status, auto-reply headers, one-click unsubscribe, stop tokens) or `ai` (the semantic classifier). tools/check_eval_corpora.py enforces the canonical vocabularies and that every disposition and objection class is covered; tools/run-eval-live.py replays each message through the live classifier and, for `deterministic` cases, asserts the documented layer-1 verdict.",
